==Trivia==
*Nonsense Mutation's name is a reference to [[wikipedia:Nonsense mutation|nonsense mutations]], a type of genetic mutation which changes a sense codon (a codon for an amino acid) in a DNA sequence into a nonsense codon (a premature stop codon), degrading or truncating the encoded protein.

